rem Square Remainders
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=120
rem Sum the maximum remainders of (a -
rem 1)^n + (a + 1)^n divided by a^2

use sequences
use io
use cli

arg Limit integer = 1000

rem Even n leaves 2. Odd n leaves 2 a n
rem mod a^2 = a (2 n mod a), whose best
rem is a (a - 1) for odd a, a (a - 2)
rem for even.
A = 3 to Limit array
Step' = A - 2 + A mod 2
Best' = A * Step
Answer = Best sum
Answer print
